        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Events: WrestleMania XXIV, WrestleMania IX\n- Places: Caesars Palace, Las Vegas, Nevada, Las Vegas Strip, Bellagio, The Mirage\n\nFacts:\n- WrestleMania IX was the first WrestleMania held outdoors, and it took place at Caesars Palace in Las Vegas, Nevada.\n- WrestleMania XXIV was the second WrestleMania held outdoors.\n- Caesars Palace is a hotel on the west side of the Las Vegas Strip between Bellagio and The Mirage.",
